---
// The payoff of post 4: the service box does not move. Only the box under
// the seam changes. Gold = the safe path (unchanged / new implementation).
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep5a">
  <div class="bep5a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: the service box, unchanged. Below it a dashed seam labelled CaseRepository with add, get, save. Under the seam two implementations side by side: InMemoryCaseRepository from the previous post and SqlCaseRepository added in this post.">
    <rect x="300" y="26" width="300" height="60" rx="10" class="good" />
    <text x="450" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="nm">service</text>
    <text x="450" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="sub mono">layered_service.py</text>
    <text x="620" y="60" class="goodt">
      <tspan data-lang-en>0 lines changed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0 dòng bị sửa</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="450" y1="86" x2="450" y2="122" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="450,132 445,122 455,122" class="hd" />

    <rect x="140" y="134" width="620" height="52" rx="10" class="seam" />
    <text x="450" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="nm mono">CaseRepository</text>
    <text x="450" y="177" text-anchor="middle" class="sub mono">add() · get() · save()</text>

    <line x1="270" y1="186" x2="270" y2="228" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="270,238 265,228 275,228" class="hd" />
    <line x1="630" y1="186" x2="630" y2="228" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="630,238 625,228 635,228" class="hd" />

    <rect x="120" y="240" width="300" height="64" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="270" y="266" text-anchor="middle" class="nm mono">InMemoryCaseRepository</text>
    <text x="270" y="286" text-anchor="middle" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>post 4 · one process dict</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bài 4 · một dict trong process</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="480" y="240" width="300" height="64" rx="10" class="good" />
    <text x="630" y="266" text-anchor="middle" class="nm mono">SqlCaseRepository</text>
    <text x="630" y="286" text-anchor="middle" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>this post · a SQLAlchemy session</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bài này · một SQLAlchemy session</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The seam from post 4 pays off: the rules never learn that storage changed. One new class under the dashed line, nothing edited above it.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đường nối (seam) của bài 4 trả lãi: luật nghiệp vụ không hề biết tầng lưu trữ đã đổi. Một class mới dưới đường đứt nét, phía trên không sửa gì.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5a text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5a .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep5a .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5a .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5a .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5a .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5a .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep5a .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5a .badfill { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5a .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5a .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5a .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5a .goodt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
